# Canonical route: the page's mining routes. Durotar for Horde and
# Elwynn Forest for Alliance 1-65, the Wetlands cave for Alliance and
# Hillsbrad Foothills for Horde 65-125, Arathi Highlands 125-175, the
# Hinterlands 175-245, Un'Goro Crater 245-300. The page's smelting
# shortcut (buy ore, smelt to about 105) is a tip, not steps: buy about
# 140 Copper Ore and 70 Tin Ore, smelt Copper to 65, learn Journeyman
# and smelt Tin, then smelt Bronze to around 100 to 110.
#
# The page's routes are drawn lines on map images, so every loop here is
# built from the reference data instead: node spawn centroids from
# objects.json, clustered per band (derive_coords.py), cross-checked
# against the zones and ores the page names. The page's routes from 125
# up are largely Classic routes the author could not test on live (the
# beta cap was 30); the loops still follow the data's densest spawns.
# The shipped reference names Lesser Bloodstone nodes in Arathi, but no
# such object exists in the data, so the Arathi loop uses Iron, Tin and
# Gold only. Rich Thorium in Un'Goro spawns only in the west and south
# of the crater, so the 275-300 loop stays on that ground.
#
# NPC/item ids resolved from the reference data (npcs.json,
# professions.json rank trainer lists):
#   Trainers: Kelsey Fargo 247226 (Elwynn), Norzsh 267328 (Valley of
#   Trials), Geofram Bouldertoe 4254 (Ironforge), Makaru 3357
#   (Orgrimmar). The starting-zone trainers teach Apprentice only,
#   matching the page; the capital trainers teach every rank.
#   Mining Pick 2901.
# Skill needed per node (from the page): Copper 1, Tin and Incendicite
# 65, Silver 75, Iron 125, Gold 155, Mithril 175, Truesilver 230, Small
# Thorium 245, Rich Thorium 275.
guide forever-professions/mining
title Mining 1-300
category Professions
coords era
levels 1-60
zone Azeroth

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice

section Mining 1-65

step Learn Mining
  only Alliance
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Mining takes one of your two primary profession slots (pairs naturally with Blacksmithing or Engineering, and yields Scarce ores like Pyrite, Bauxite and Pitchblende). Kelsey Fargo in Elwynn Forest teaches Apprentice Mining at any character level. Buy a Mining Pick before you start: it stays in your bags, it does not need to be equipped, but you cannot mine without one. Turn on Find Minerals once you have learned it: it is in the Mining box of the Professions window, and it is off by default. Drag it to your action bar; it switches off every time you die, and you can only track minerals or herbs, not both. Darnassus has no Mining trainer; the closest is Kurdram Stonehammer in Auberdine, Darkshore.
  train Mining Apprentice npc 247226
  buy 2901 x1 nearest

step Learn Mining
  only Horde
  zone Durotar
  tip Mining takes one of your two primary profession slots (pairs naturally with Blacksmithing or Engineering, and yields Scarce ores like Pyrite, Bauxite and Pitchblende). Norzsh in the Valley of Trials teaches Apprentice Mining at any character level. Buy a Mining Pick before you start: it stays in your bags, it does not need to be equipped, but you cannot mine without one. Turn on Find Minerals once you have learned it: it is in the Mining box of the Professions window, and it is off by default. Drag it to your action bar; it switches off every time you die, and you can only track minerals or herbs, not both.
  train Mining Apprentice npc 267328
  buy 2901 x1 nearest

step Copper in Durotar
  only Horde
  zone Durotar
  tip Mine every Copper Vein and Poor Copper Vein you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 65; Poor Copper Veins give Copper Ore and Rough Stone from skill 1. One or two laps is usually enough ore to reach 65 once smelted; stop at Razor Hill to smelt. With gold to spend, smelting skips most of this band: buy about 140 Copper Ore and 70 Tin Ore, smelt Copper to 65, then Tin and Bronze to around 100 to 110. Mulgore's cave, five Copper Veins with a very fast regrow, is the alternative if Durotar is busy.
  goto 42.1,68.1 "Poor Copper Vein" r 30
  goto 41.6,71.6 "Poor Copper Vein" r 30
  goto 45.4,72.8 "Poor Copper Vein" r 30
  goto 46.5,67.6 "Poor Copper Vein" r 30
