  goto 41.8,61.1 "Poor Copper Vein" r 30
  goto 43.3,53.4 "Poor Copper Vein" r 30
  goto 36.0,45.4 "Copper Vein" r 30
  goto 35.6,35.5 "Copper Vein" r 30
  goto 36.1,28.9 "Copper Vein" r 30
  skill Mining 65

step Copper in Elwynn Forest
  only Alliance
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Mine every Copper Vein and Poor Copper Vein you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 65; Poor Copper Veins give Copper Ore and Rough Stone from skill 1. Move back and forth along the route, and clear the cave if you are high enough level: the veins inside regrow fast, and you may not need to leave it. Stop at Goldshire to smelt. With gold to spend, smelting skips most of this band: buy about 140 Copper Ore and 70 Tin Ore, smelt Copper to 65, then Tin and Bronze to around 100 to 110.
  goto 47.3,32.3 "Poor Copper Vein" r 30
  goto 52.1,32.4 "Poor Copper Vein" r 30
