# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Mining 65-125

section Mining 65-125

step Journeyman Mining
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Journeyman Mining raises the cap to 150 and needs skill 50. Geofram Bouldertoe in Ironforge teaches it.
  train Mining Journeyman npc 4254

step Journeyman Mining
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Journeyman Mining raises the cap to 150 and needs skill 50. Makaru in Orgrimmar teaches it.
  train Mining Journeyman npc 3357

step Tin and Incendicite in the Wetlands
  only Alliance
  zone Wetlands
  tip Tin Veins need 65, Silver Veins 75. The Wetlands cave is the best spot for Alliance: full of Tin Veins and Incendicite Mineral Veins with a very fast regrow. The mobs inside are around level 20, and in Forever they come back much faster, so outlevel them by a few levels. Smelt leftover Copper and Tin into Bronze before heading out; Bronze stops giving points around 105.
