step Tin in Hillsbrad Foothills
  only Horde
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Tin Veins need 65, Silver Veins 75. Hillsbrad Foothills is the best open mining route for this band; it is popular, so expect company, and the route passes near the Horde town of Tarren Mill. Smelt leftover Copper and Tin into Bronze before heading out; Bronze stops giving points around 105. The Barrens and Ashenvale are the quieter alternatives.
