# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Mining 125-175

section Mining 125-175

step Expert Mining
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Expert Mining raises the cap to 225 and needs skill 125. Geofram Bouldertoe in Ironforge teaches it.
