step Expert Mining
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Expert Mining raises the cap to 225 and needs skill 125. Makaru in Orgrimmar teaches it.
  train Mining Expert npc 3357

step Iron and Gold in Arathi Highlands
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Iron Deposits need 125, Gold Veins 155. Arathi Highlands has four caves worth going all the way into: you will not see every vein from the entrance. Low-level players should skip all four caves; low-level Alliance can detour south of Hammerfall instead. Thousand Needles is the safest alternative for characters around level 30. Smelting can help here too: about 20 Iron Ore smelted to 135, and at 155 Smelt Gold takes you to 175 on about 22 Gold Ore, if the prices make sense.
