section Mining 175-245

step Mithril in the Hinterlands
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Mithril Deposits need 175, Truesilver Deposits 230. The Hinterlands loop is the pick for this band. Skip the route the page marks in red: level 62 elites patrol it. Lower levels may also want to skip the cave marked on the page's map. Tanaris is the alternative zone; its four marked caves are for level 60s.
