# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Mining 245-275

section Mining 245-275

step Small Thorium in Un'Goro Crater
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Small Thorium Veins need 245. Un'Goro Crater is the pick for this band; the two marked caves hold two or three veins each, though lower levels will probably skip the south cave. Felwood is the alternative: its marked cave is small, with few mobs, and usually holds two veins. Skip the other two Felwood caves at Jaedenar, especially Shadow Hold, unless you can stealth through them.
