# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Mining 275-300

section Mining 275-300

step Rich Thorium in Un'Goro Crater
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Rich Thorium Veins open up at 275. This loop covers the same ground as the last band, now with Rich Thorium in the mix; the veins cluster in the west and south of the crater. Winterspring is the alternative: its caves are mostly manageable, but the gorge has patrolling elites and the far cave is not recommended for most players. Eastern Plaguelands has a run of level 57 to 58 elites; skip it unless geared or stealthed.
